# Query the graph first

Before responding to ANY prompt:

1. Run `graphify query "<topic of the prompt>"` first.
2. Use the graph results to understand codebase context.
3. Then write code based on what the graph reveals.

Never write code without querying the graph first.

Use `graphify-out/graph.json` as the source of truth for this codebase.
